## Convention

| Symbol | Net Meaning | Net Place Type |
|--------|-------------|----------------|
| `[ ]`  | Place unmarked (token=0) | `task_pending` / `feature_pending` |
| `[~]`  | Place marked (token=1) — agent actively working | `task_active` / `feature_active` |
| `[x]`  | Place marked (token=1) — completed, token consumed | `task_done` / `feature_done` |
| `[!]`  | Place marked (token=1) — blocked (deadlock / capacity) | `task_blocked` / `feature_blocked` |

**Hierarchy** = subnet composition (flat union via `f{N}_` prefixes).
**Metadata** = transition annotations (reasoning, feature slug, resource needs).
**Thoughts** = separate `---` + bullets; tools strip.
**DONE rotation** = net place `feature_done` tokens archived to `WORK_ARCHIVE.md` (never auto-read).

